I'll implement the Robot Name functionality according to the instructions.

Here's my plan:
1. Create a Robot class with a name getter that generates a random name on first use
2. Names follow the format: 2 uppercase letters + 3 digits (e.g., RX837)
3. Implement a reset method to wipe a robot's name and generate a new one when accessed
4. Ensure all names are unique by tracking used names
