1. Fix error message casing to match expected values
2. Fix the digit length validation logic (the `> 10` check incorrectly triggers for 11-digit numbers)

Let me analyze the expected error messages:
- "Incorrect number of digits" (not "must be 10 or 11 digits")
- "11 digits must start with 1" (not "11 digits must start with the country code 1")
- "More than 11 digits" (not "more than 11 digits is not allowed")
